---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Contact us" description="Contact Ukraine Medical Admissions by email or the enquiry form: what to include in your message, and what we can and cannot help with.">
  <div class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Contact</span><h1>Contact us</h1><p>For a general question, use the enquiry form on this page. To apply, use <a style="color:#fff" href={SITE.ctaHref}>{SITE.cta}</a>.</p></div></div>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} />
  <section style="padding-top:1rem"><div class="wrap grid grid-2" style="align-items:start">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Email</h2>
      <p><a class="link-standalone" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
      <p>We reply by email only, not through messaging apps.</p>
      <h2>Before you write</h2>
      <p>Most questions about fees, requirements and the process are answered in the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>, the <a href="/admissions/">admissions guide</a> and the <a href="/tuition-fees/">fees guide</a>.</p>
      <h2>What to include in your message</h2>
      <p>A short message with these details lets us give a useful answer the first time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>the course you want to study, for example medicine or dentistry, and the year you hope to start;</li>
        <li>your school-leaving qualification, the subjects you took and your grades so far, or when your results are due;</li>
        <li>the country you live in, and the country where you hope to work after graduating;</li>
        <li>any universities you are already considering;</li>
        <li>your question, in your own words.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Please do not attach passport scans, certificates or other documents. We do not need them at this stage, and email is not the place to send them.</p>
      <h2>What we can and cannot help with</h2>
      <p>We can answer questions about choosing a course, reading a university fee schedule, the entry requirements to check, the documents to start gathering and the stages of an application. Where a university's facts have not yet been verified from its official pages, we tell you so.</p>
      <p>We are an independent service: we are not part of any university or government body, and we cannot guarantee admission, a visa or recognition of a qualification. Admission decisions are made by the university, and recognition by the regulator in the country where you plan to work. See <a href="/services/">what we do</a> and our <a href="/disclosure/">independence and referral disclosure</a>.</p>
      <h2>Applying?</h2>
      <p>If you are ready to apply, use <a href={SITE.ctaHref}>{SITE.cta}</a> instead of this form. It asks for the details above step by step, so we can reply with the next steps for your course.</p>
      <h2>Complaints</h2>
      <p>If something has gone wrong, see our <a href="/complaints-policy/">complaints policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <form class="card" method="post" action="/api/enquiry.php" data-form novalidate>
      <input type="hidden" name="ts" value="" />
      <h2 style="font-size:1.25rem">Send an enquiry</h2>
      <input type="hidden" name="type" value="enquiry" />
      <label class="field">Your name<input name="name" type="text" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" /></label>
      <label class="field">Email<input name="email" type="email" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="email" /></label>
      <label class="field">Your message<textarea name="message" rows="5" required maxlength="4000"></textarea></label>
      <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div>
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required /> <span>I agree to Ukraine Medical Admissions storing this enquiry and replying by email, as described in the <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a>.</span></label>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send enquiry</button>
      <p class="err" data-form-error role="alert" hidden style="color:#B91C1C;font-size:.9rem;margin-top:.75rem"></p>
    </form>
  </div></section>
<script src="../../scripts/form-validate.ts"></script>
</Base>
<style>.hp{position:absolute;left:-9999px}</style>

